# Virallink — monorepo environment pointer.
#
# This repository is split into two self-contained apps; each loads its OWN
# .env, and neither depends on this file. Edit those two files instead:
#
#   apps/api/.env.example   -> apps/api/.env    (backend; Express + MySQL)
#   apps/web/.env.example   -> apps/web/.env    (frontend; Next.js)
#
# The API is independent of the web app. The web app is independent of the API:
# it only needs NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL (public origin) and API_INTERNAL_URL
# (loopback address of the API).
#
# A root .env like this one is NOT read by either app in normal operation. If
# you have a legacy root .env, migrate its values into the two files above.
